\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Distribution of out-of-distribution scores for in-distribution versus out-of-distribution test windows on a global-normalised dataset. The feature-space detector (left) assigns systematically higher scores to OOD windows; the softmax detector (right) assigns them \emph  {lower} scores, inverting the decision and producing an AUROC below chance --- the mechanism analysed in the main text.}}{39}{figure.9}\protected@file@percent }
